Package: tidybrregmcp
Title: Model Context Protocol Server Derived from 'tidybrreg'
Version: 0.6.0
Authors@R:
    person("Sondre", "Skarsten", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "sondreskarsten@gmail.com")
Description: Exposes the exported functions of 'tidybrreg' as Model Context
    Protocol (MCP) tools. The tool catalogue, every tool's title,
    description, argument documentation and input schema are derived at
    run time from the installed 'tidybrreg' namespace and its help pages,
    so the server changes exactly when 'tidybrreg' changes and adds no
    interpretation of the register's data of its own: tools return the
    tibbles 'tidybrreg' returns, with its column names, its codes, its
    attributes and its typed conditions. Serves over standard streams or
    streamable HTTP.
